{"id":"aa8f08f5040477a3","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-thresholdgraph.md","title":"Threshold graphs through stable-set separation","display":"df-thresholdgraph — Threshold graphs through stable-set separation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-thresholdgraph","aliases":["27-df-thresholdgraph"],"display":"df-thresholdgraph — Threshold graphs through stable-set separation","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.7 Definition 9.9 and Theorem 9.28","source_printed_pages":"438–439","source_pdf_pages":"462–463","verification_status":"source-definition-and-equivalent-reformulation-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-thresholdgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-thresholdgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-thresholdgraph — Threshold graphs through stable-set separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.7 Definition 9.9 and Theorem 9.28"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"438–439"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"462–463"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-equivalent-reformulation-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=[n]\">\\(V=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\binom V2=\\{\\{i,j\\}\\subseteq V\\mid i\\ne j\\}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\binom V2=\\{\\{i,j\\}\\subseteq V\\mid i\\ne j\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,E)\">\\(G=(V,E)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_S\">\\(\\mathbf1_S\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq V\">\\(S\\subseteq V\\)</span> 的示性向量。 本节引入谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_G\">\\(f_G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_G:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f_G(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}(x_i\\wedge x_j),\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\bigvee\\emptyset\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_G:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f_G(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}(x_i\\wedge x_j),\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\bigvee\\emptyset\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\quad(S\\subseteq V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\quad(S\\subseteq V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow f_G\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow f_G\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(w,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\;\\forall S\\subseteq V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\le t\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(w,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\;\\forall S\\subseteq V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\le t\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 9.9、Theorem 9.28，印刷 pp.438–439／PDF pp.462–463。稳定集恰对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_G\">\\(f_G\\)</span> 的假输入，定义要求分离全部稳定集。空边图与空顶点图都对应常0函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$V=[n]$，$E\\subseteq\\binom V2=\\{\\{i,j\\}\\subseteq V\\mid i\\ne j\\}$，$G=(V,E)$；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\mathbf1_S$ 是 $S\\subseteq V$ 的示性向量。 本节引入谓词 $\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)$、$\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)$ 与函数 $f_G$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"V=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\binom V2=\\{\\{i,j\\}\\subseteq V\\mid i\\ne j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"f_G","display":false},{"tex":"f_G:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad f_G(x)\\coloneqq\\bigvee_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}(x_i\\wedge x_j),\\quad(x\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\bigvee\\emptyset\\coloneqq0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)\\quad(S\\subseteq V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow f_G\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ThGraph}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists(w,t)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\;\\forall S\\subseteq V\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{Stable}_G(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\le t\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"f_G","display":false}],"bytes":1795,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-thresholdgraph|df-thresholdgraph — Threshold graphs through stable-set separation]]"},{"id":"b279b5b4eb4a60be","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E_G)$、$H=([n],E_H)$ 为有限简单图。$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，消去判据见 [[27-thm-thresholdgraphobstructions]]；边集投影 $\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。对 $K\\in\\{G,H\\}$，$\\deg_K:[n]\\to\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$、$d_j(K)$（$j\\in[n]$）及 $d(K)$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"13c327637bd1636b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$G=([n],E)$ 为有限简单图；$\\mathrm{ThGraph}$ 见 [[27-df-thresholdgraph]]，$\\mathrm{Graph}$、$\\mathrm{Vert}$、$\\mathrm{Edges}$ 见 [[27-df-graph]]。$H,J$ 为任意有限简单图；诱导子图 $H[S]$ 和邻域 $N_H(v)$ 仅对下式局部指定的合法顶点子集及顶点定义。图同构谓词 $\\mathrm{Iso}$、三个图 $H_1,H_2,H_3$ 和消去谓词 $\\mathrm{Peel}$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5"]}